RecipeExecutor
├── configuration
│   ├── deploy through ImmutableFactory with explicit curator and adapter
│   ├── reject configuration by non-owner and execution by non-caller
│   ├── commit every field; replacing configuration invalidates prior recipes
│   └── block reentry and configuration during callbacks
├── evaluation
│   ├── read bounded complete words from static results and runtime calldata
│   ├── reject forward result references and missing runtime/inputs
│   ├── use checked arithmetic and full-precision MulDiv
│   └── revert failed equality/upper bounds and roll back earlier writes
├── adapter actions
│   ├── enforce exact ordered leaves and group lengths
│   ├── reject native value, changed leaves, stale roots and revoked roles
│   ├── skip a zero-guard group without decoding its runtime
│   └── approve from adapter, reset nonzero allowance, handle no return and reject false
├── lending recipe
│   ├── supply LBTC, checked USDC borrowing, immediate RWA acquisition
│   ├── preserve preexisting USDC and clear allowances
│   └── reject altered effects, insufficient output, unsafe health and repeated excess debt
└── liquidity recipe
    ├── source in order, authenticate signed swap and check exact post consumption
    ├── require issuer receipt and cap outstanding exposure
    └── reject bypass of outer caller, omitted redemption and changed entrypoint/amount
